4.1.1.2 Lake Charles Area Current Wind Load Requirements Currently, the Louisiana State Uniform Construction Code Council (LSUCCC) reviews and adopts the state uniform construction code as part of Louisiana’s efforts to “maintain reasonable standards of construction in
